      "content": "okay here is what i have so far. it's kinda weird when u look at it:\n\n- Oct 12, 2am-5am, 402 Maple St, \"leak inspection\"\n- Oct 14, 3am-6am, 415 Maple St, \"valve check\"\n- Oct 15, 11pm-2am, 408 Maple St, \"line testing\"\n- Oct 18, 1am-4am, 422 Maple St, \"meter adjustment\"\n\nall these are on the same block. why would they be doing \"leak inspections\" at 2 in the morning if it's just regular city maintenance?? it seems like they're trying to be quiet so people don't notice them digging. can u look at this and tell me if u see anything that doesn't look like normal maintenance?",
